@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title SIM-ddd-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: AuthorizationController" as ctl
participant "rest: RestSupport" as rest
participant "auth: AuthorizationApplicationService" as auth
participant "directory: DirectoryApplicationService" as directory
participant "repo: AuthorizationRepository" as repo
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. explain(bearer, input)
activate ctl
ctl -> ctl: 2. check(bearer, input, true)
activate ctl
ctl -> rest: 3. principal(bearer)
activate rest
deactivate rest
ctl -> auth: 4. require(principal, rbac:authz:invoke, false)
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over ctl
Validate UI permission vs API operationId input contract;
choose explicit target userId or actor.id().
end note
opt target differs from actor
ctl -> directory: 5. user(principal, targetUserId)
activate directory
deactivate directory
end
alt API explanation
ctl -> auth: 6. explainApi(targetUserId, system, operationId)
activate auth
auth -> auth: 7. stableApiExplanation(targetUserId, system, operationId)
activate auth
loop at most 3 attempts
auth -> repo: 8. version()
activate repo
deactivate repo
auth -> auth: 9. unavailableReason(targetUserId, system)
activate auth
auth -> repo: 10. systemEnabled(system)
activate repo
deactivate repo
auth -> repo: 11. identity(targetUserId)
activate repo
deactivate repo
auth --> auth: unavailable or null
deactivate auth
opt available target
auth -> auth: 12. stableEffective(targetUserId, system)
activate auth
deactivate auth
auth -> auth: 13. stableApi(targetUserId, system, operationId)
activate auth
deactivate auth
end
auth -> repo: 14. version()
activate repo
deactivate repo
note over auth
unchanged → return status, snapshot and decision; changed → retry all reads.
Unstable after three attempts → 503 AUTHORIZATION_UNSTABLE.
end note
end
deactivate auth
auth --> ctl: ApiExplanation
deactivate auth
else UI explanation
ctl -> auth: 15. unavailableReason(targetUserId, system)
activate auth
deactivate auth
opt available target
ctl -> auth: 16. effective(targetUserId, system)
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over ctl
Use Effective.has for the UI permission.
end note
end
end
note over ctl
Unavailable target: empty effective, allowed=false,
reason and trace carry USER_DISABLED or SYSTEM_DISABLED.
Available target: reason ALLOW or DENY. RestSupport.ok supplies the HTTP envelope.
end note
deactivate ctl
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml